              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ECreating About, Services, and Contact as block-driven pages forced me to codify our CTA journey. Each button now points to a published node via content picker, which means editors can swap destinations without touching Razor.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
